OL,3,GNEWSAFree clear-up has big engagement
OL,4,Aon social media
OL,5,
OL,6,FA resident of Launceston, Cornwall,
OL,7,Fgoes above and beyond battling weeds
OL,8,Fand overgrown pathways free of charge
OL,9,Fto keep fit and help the community.
OL,11,FJeremy Vernon, 51, said despite having
OL,12,Fhis kidney removed due to cancer he
OL,13,Fcould not resist clearing neglected
OL,14,Fpaths in his free time and it had made
OL,15,Fhim a hit on social media.
OL,17,FIn one area he cut back the brambles
OL,18,Fand scraped off all the weeds before
OL,19,Fspending several hours pressure washing
OL,20,Fthe steps.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
