OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said he did it due to "the
OL,7,Fsatisfaction after walking down the
OL,8,Fpath after it has been cleaned and the
OL,9,Freaction you get from members of the
OL,10,Fpublic and people on social media that
OL,11,Fseem to appreciate what's being done".
